      "end_block": "B041",
      "hook": "Juliana's trembling, shackle-bound hands drag a loaf of bread toward her chest as she clutches it desperately.",
      "cliffhanger": "Juliana declares with fierce loyalty, 'I will not give them my husband. I will not betray him,' leaving her fate and Alexander's secret hanging.",
      "why": "It combines raw vulnerability with a powerful defiant vow, making viewers root for her survival.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger may not know why she is imprisoned or who her husband is, but her loyalty and peril are clear."
    },
    {
      "title": "Wedding Bells Seal Her Fate",
      "start_block": "B043",
      "end_block": "B056",
      "hook": "Juliana's eyes snap wide open as a deep resonant church bell tolls from above, startling her.",
      "cliffhanger": "Juliana grips the bars, whispering 'Alexander...' with a brave smile as the screen cuts to black, leaving her execution imminent.",
      "why": "The bells signal both a wedding and her execution, creating a chilling countdown that ends on an unresolved emotional beat.",
      "context_gap": "Viewers may not know whose wedding it is or why it means her death, but the dread is immediate."
    },
    {
      "title": "Bread, Tears, and a Prayer",
      "start_block": "B011",
      "end_block": "B035",
      "hook": "Juliana asks breathlessly, 'Why?' as a guard slips bread through the bars, his quiet compassion shocking her.",
      "cliffhanger": "Juliana prays fervently, 'Keep him safe. Wherever he is,' leaving Alexander's safety and her own fate unresolved.",
      "why": "The unexpected kindness in a dungeon creates emotional contrast, and her prayer raises stakes for her missing husband.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger may not know who 'him' refers to, but the desperation and love are universally felt."
    }
  ],
